msgid "Connect the barometer to the autopilot's I2C port as shown below"
msgstr "将气压计连接到飞控的 I2C 端口，如下图所示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:34
#: 9cdab2264dd14b3ca0f5a9053b09b735
msgid ""
"On the top of the Drotek MS5611 board, the \"I2C\" jumper should be "
"soldered.  Look for \"I2C/SPI\" written on the board."
msgstr "在 Drotek MS5611 板的顶部，应焊接「I2C」跳线。在板上查找「I2C/SPI」字样。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:40
#: 2e50af5a8116426d91d54a4439a16006
msgid ""
":ref:`BARO_PROBE_EXT <BARO_PROBE_EXT>` to 4 for the Drotek MS5611 or 2 for "
"the Adafruit BMP280.  Reboot the autopilot after changing this parameter."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BARO_PROBE_EXT <BARO_PROBE_EXT>` 设置为 4（Drotek MS5611）或 2（Adafruit "
"BMP280）。修改此参数后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:35
#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:41
#: 716b8936e9564175beb78491f39b2e3b 910b449c03a544ec87c4f7e7a2f53226
#: c7f7e4e577494fdeb20c9b39fc15e24e ee5c6421494b45ba848b3feb8677ffb0
#: f0e9dd9786254034974291545b6f830c
msgid ""
":ref:`BARO_PRIMARY <BARO_PRIMARY>` to 1 to use the external barometer as the"
" primary"
msgstr "将 :ref:`BARO_PRIMARY <BARO_PRIMARY>` 设置为 1 以使用外部气压计作为主气压计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:38
#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:44
#: 0aa3ee2151454f31aaa597568aecc05a 2562ff7324af4e5ab57f8b812a5426b5
#: 3095f1d22c8d4f5aaf0ef74dcae1a0ac 79f44ab848494d748ab186e944cf6c1c
#: c108e4ef4a8a4f2993beac7d2846bf80
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:44
#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:50
#: 02abdc3f75904a379a08f8e32db0be0a 266eff7824ab4b59877e534fc795ab9c
#: a487e6966d6347f787bf51c95c4a5fed a6fecd8c5d9041d389c74a514108defc
#: acb392a3ee07448fb492cd90f85b3291
msgid ""
"Real-time pressure and temperature from the barometer are sent to the ground"
" station.  If using Mission Planner they are visible on the Flight Data >> "
"Status tab, look for \"press_abs2\" and \"press_temp2\"."
msgstr ""
"气压计的实时气压和温度数据会发送到地面站。若使用 Mission Planner，可在「飞行数据 >> "
"状态」选项卡中查看，搜索「press_abs2」和「press_temp2」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:46
#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:52
#: 0514d8a920ff4796880e74ffa413388f c57d3c19b1d64fccb9354c54e58fcb50
#: c963090a079f4b46ae7e80f1891404d5 d3653517dff44d638f28c868725fbf9a
#: f2a8baf3667e4398bd2ba245041f5cbb
msgid ""
"Mission Planner's MAVLink Inspector can also be used to view the data.  From"
" the Flight Data screen press Ctrl-F, then push the \"MAVLink In\" button "
"and then expand the view and look for SCALED_PRESSURE2."
msgstr ""
"也可使用 Mission Planner 的 MAVLink 检查器查看数据。在飞行数据界面按 Ctrl-F，点击「MAVLink "
"In」按钮，展开视图后查找 SCALED_PRESSURE2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:53
#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:59
#: 21926cbe69a84c648e99233a36d61edf 2f2452d3e684487bb9ddc324c6630a15
#: 54202964552b4bd781d4ea8ada1fade0 ace93c0436d04556bbd54f97397fca47
#: fb2cc0cedc5c4bd8934819dafab3733c
msgid ""
"If using ArduPilot onboard OSD, the secondary barometer's temperature "
"reading can be displayed using the OSDn_BTEMP panel."
msgstr "若使用 ArduPilot 板载 OSD，可使用 OSDn_BTEMP 面板显示副气压计的温度读数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:23
#: 021ed6b2452440edb95db49836aa6d18 0ff4a3fabe6f4dc19b24deb4e17f0c82
#: 50fdcdbf99f143dd9b47a3a835039c7b 979e5f4982d34c6684750a694ee47f3f
msgid ""
"`UAV-DEV GmbH DroneCAN Airspeed and Barometer Sensor - AUAV "
"<https://wiki.uav-dev.com/en/product/airspeed/auav>`__"
msgstr ""
"`UAV-DEV GmbH DroneCAN 空速与气压计传感器 - AUAV <https://wiki.uav-"
"dev.com/en/product/airspeed/auav>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:34
#: 0c636ca8baa84a92a58b769525934e63 7e55d9c957ee499195a9679fbc987b6c
#: d88c6657e0fa467a81e5261051c1d36b eacd3e4747b94085beeae4a994d2cd94
msgid ""
":ref:`BARO_PROBE_EXT <BARO_PROBE_EXT>` to 4 for the MS5611 or 2 for the "
"Adafruit BMP280.  Reboot the autopilot after changing this parameter."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BARO_PROBE_EXT <BARO_PROBE_EXT>`：MS5611 设为 4，Adafruit BMP280 设为 "
"2。修改此参数后需重启飞控。"
